In conclusion, our consortium proposes a comprehensive solution that meets the client's requirements for an intelligent assistance tool, while ensuring sovereignty, transparency, and regulatory compliance. Our approach combines agile delivery with a phase-gate structure, leveraging our partnerships with sovereign cloud providers and health-IT integrators to ensure a robust and explainable solution. We are confident that our proposal will improve the efficiency and quality of care at CHRB, while aligning with their environmental goals and values.
